<div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1.5px solid #9ca3af; border-radius: 10px; padding: 28px 22px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
  <h1 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 8px 0;">幹事頼んだよ🍺</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #374151; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">こうやればすぐだから！</p>

  <div style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 22px;">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
      <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 6px;">① みんなの出発駅を入力</div>
        <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px dashed #9ca3af; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; color: #374151; display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 6px;">
          <span>幹事太郎：<b>新宿駅</b></span>
          <span>＋</span>
          <span>参加者B：<b>千葉駅</b></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 6px;">② 集合駅＆お店候補を自動提案</div>
        <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px dashed #9ca3af; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; color: #374151;">
          <div>🎯 集合駅：<b>秋葉原駅</b>（遠方でも負担が偏りにくい！）</div>
          <div style="color: #6b7280; margin-top: 2px;">🍺 周辺のお店候補3件＋Googleマップリンク付き</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px;">
        <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin-bottom: 6px;">③ URLコピーやLINEでそのまま共有</div>
        <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px dashed #9ca3af; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; font-size: 11px; color: #374151;">
          📲 登録不要の閲覧専用リンクをグループに送るだけ！
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #111827; margin: 0 0 12px 0;">あとは任せたぞ！</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;">
    <%= link_to "ログイン", login_path,
          data: {
            controller: "hover-label",
            hover_label_hover_value: "任せろ！",
            action: "mouseenter->hover-label#enter mouseleave->hover-label#leave"
          },
          style: "min-width: 112px; background-color: #6b7280; color: #ffffff; padding: 9px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;" %>
    <%= link_to "新規登録", signup_path,
          data: {
            controller: "hover-label",
            hover_label_hover_value: "引き受けた！",
            action: "mouseenter->hover-label#enter mouseleave->hover-label#leave"
          },
          style: "min-width: 112px; background-color: #ffffff; color: #1f2937; border: 1.5px solid #6b7280; padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;" %>
  </div>
</div>
